                "text": "Every American has been touched in a personal way by cancer \u2013 whether it\u2019s as a survivor or seeing it impact a family member or friend.\n\nGreat to catch up with my friend, Dr. Hans-Peter Kiem from @fredhutch, to discuss emerging cell and gene therapies for the treatment of cancer. https://t.co/US0XRHAwSL",
