                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Colorado anti-discrimination law was created to stop unfair treatment and focuses on regulating actions, not what people say.\n\nWhen we reduce this issue to just free speech, we undermine the inclusive values we strive for as a nation.",
