                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Our LGBTQI+ elders are disproportionately impacted by HIV and AIDS.\n \nAs an @EqualityCaucus member, I\u2019m working to end the stigma, ensure access to preventative medicines like PrEP for all of those at risk, and improve access to testing and treatment. https://t.co/5IQDGLD3QF",
