                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Years after the beginning of the HIV and AIDS epidemic, the disease still disproportionately impacts gay men.\n\nAs an @EqualityCaucus member, I\u2019m combatting HIV stigma and raising awareness to encourage testing, prevention, and treatment. #NGMHAAD #StopHIVTogether https://t.co/e9LpWL1ZQw",
