                "text": "Today is #WorldAIDSDay \u2013 a day to renew our fight to end HIV across the globe.\n\nWe must address the impact of HIV on all folks, including communities of color, transgender folks, and others, by increasing access to preventative medicine, testing, and treatment. https://t.co/Snbk9w3uRr",
